    {"id":"b6l","type":"text","x":150,"y":725,"width":720,"height":110,"text":"services/rag.py                            (Vectorless Tree RAG)\n\n_parse_id_list(text) -> list[str]         extract JSON array from LLM response\n_resolve_ids(raw, children) -> list[str]  map bare numbers/roman to node IDs\nretrieve_by_tree(query, tree, llm)        Step1: LLM picks chapters -> Step2: LLM picks sections\ncreate_tool_for_tree(tree, llm, name, desc)  -> @tool for LangChain agent","fontSize":13,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":57,"version":1,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":[],"roundness":null},

